      "content": "that makes sense. so if we look at the \"cross-national data\" u mentioned, how do they explain the persistence of those gaps even when socioeconomic factors are supposedly leveled out? is there a consensus among those researchers on which specific biological traits or evolutionary paths they think account for why certain groups maintain higher average IQ scores regardless of environment?",
